            "snippets": [
              "# Trump Lands a Blow, But No Knockout, to China’s Slowing Economy\n*Terms of Trade is a daily newsletter that untangles a world embroiled in trade wars.* *Sign up here.*\n\nU.S. President Donald Trump’s latest tariff threat will damage China’s already slowing economy and force new measures by policy makers in Beijing to head off a deeper slump"
            ]
